Liquidate_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not a settler
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is a settler
    ├── given the contract is halted
    │   └── it should revert
    └── given the contract is not halted
        ├── when the batch is empty or holds more than 100 ids
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when the batch holds 1 to 100 ids
            ├── when the market does not exist
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when the market exists
                ├── when an id was never opened
                │   └── it should revert
                └── when every id was opened
                    ├── when a position belongs to another market
                    │   └── it should revert
                    └── when every position belongs to the market
                        ├── given a position has already ended
                        │   ├── it should skip it
                        │   └── it should liquidate the others
                        └── given every position is open
                            ├── when the price is not positive
                            │   └── it should revert
                            └── when the price is positive
                                ├── when the tick is outside a position's life
                                │   └── it should revert
                                └── when the tick is inside every position's life
                                    ├── when the tick is from the future
                                    │   └── it should revert
                                    └── when the tick is not from the future
                                        ├── when the price does not touch a position's line
                                        │   └── it should revert
                                        └── when the price touches every position's line
                                            ├── it should close each position
                                            ├── it should keep each stake as free money, less the loser fee
                                            ├── it should accrue the fees once
                                            ├── it should emit {PositionLiquidated} for each
                                            └── it should return the number liquidated
